MRO----> method resolution order
        will tell which method/variable will call first


        Head Element and Tail Elements

        ABCDEFG

        1 Take the head as first
        2 compare the head element to other elements

        if head is not in tail element other,then outside
        if it equal then go for next elemenents


        MRO(P) = P+ [MRO(X),MRO(Y),MRO(C),XYC]
                = P+[XABO,YBCO,CO,XYC]
                PX+[ABO,YBCO,CO,YC]
                PXA+[BO,YBCO,CO,YC]
                PXAY+[BO,BCO,CO,C]
                PXAYB+[0,CO,CO,C]
                PXAYBC+[0,0,0]
               ------> PXAYBCO


